---
import Prose from "../layouts/Prose.astro";
import { settings, images, siteImage } from "../lib/site.mjs";
const pic = siteImage("clay-ring-dish-painted-blossoms");
const aiInUse = Object.values(images).some((r) => r.kind === "ai-illustration");
---
<Prose title="Making a life, not just a living." eyebrow="About" description={`${settings.siteName} is an independent lifestyle journal for the hours after work: small hobbies, easy plans and a short, honest shopping list.`} path="/about/" image={pic.src}
  dek="Helping women fall in love with the life they live outside of work.">
  <p class="lede-serif">Your career can be a big part of your life without being your whole life.</p>
  <p>{settings.siteName} is for the person who closes the laptop at 5:01 and thinks, &ldquo;right, what now?&rdquo; We write about the hobbies, plans and small projects that fill the hours after work, and we point to the supplies that make a first attempt easier. We like a good career. We just think life gets to be bigger than it.</p>

  <h2>What we believe</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>A hobby does not have to be profitable, productive or photogenic. Enjoying it is the whole job.</li>
    <li>Being a beginner is a treat. Lopsided pots are part of the fun.</li>
    <li>A good evening should not need a big budget, a car, a partner or a large friend group.</li>
    <li>Having something to look forward to changes how the entire week feels.</li>
  </ul>

  <figure class="prose__figure">
    <img src={pic.src} alt={pic.alt} loading="lazy" width="1152" height="896" />
    <figcaption>{pic.caption}</figcaption>
  </figure>

  <h2 id="standards">How we work: our editorial standards</h2>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Written by the editors.</strong> Stories are published under the name of the editorial team, with no single named author.</li>
    <li><strong>No invented experience.</strong> We do not make up personal anecdotes, product tests, reviews or reader numbers. We do not claim to have tested a product unless a page says so.</li>
    <li><strong>Checked picks.</strong> Before a product appears, we check its Amazon listing: that it is the right item, in stock, and sold by Amazon or by the maker. We write our own descriptions and say who each item is not for.</li>
    <li><strong>No prices or star ratings.</strong> Amazon sets those, and they change. We show neither.</li>
    <li><strong>Commerce, in the open.</strong> Some shopping links may earn us a commission. It never changes what we recommend. Details are in our <a href="/affiliate-disclosure/">affiliate disclosure</a>.</li>
    <li><strong>How we use AI.</strong> We use AI tools to help with research, drafting, organisation and the running of the site. We do not claim firsthand experience, personal testing or human review that did not happen.{aiInUse && ' Some pictures on this site are AI-generated illustrations; each one is labelled as such and none is used to show what a particular product looks like.'} Please confirm important details, such as cost, safety and availability, with the provider before you rely on them.</li>
    <li><strong>Corrections.</strong> If we got something wrong, write to <a href={`mailto:${settings.contactEmail}`}>{settings.contactEmail}</a> and we will fix it.</li>
  </ul>

  <p class="hand-sign">Plans Past Five. Making a life, not just a living.</p>
</Prose>
